"Psi, the attribute of projection and psychic sense, becomes open to humans at Grade D."
"Meta, which magnifies every other attribute, becomes open to humans at Grade C."
"Equilibrium rewards harmony with nature but is the only attribute able to punish its owner."
"Thanatos feeds on death, granting experience and essence from nearby kills."
"Ward is an attribute that raises a regenerating shield over all vital energies."
"At level 50 secondary attributes unlock, letting owners re-weight each attribute's gifts."
"At Grade D the baseline cap rises to 25 and each capped attribute earns five bonus points."
